
   /A - Abort (quit without saving this message)
   /D - Delete a line
   /H - Help
   /I - Insert a new line
   /L - List this message
   /N - Turn on or off the line numbers
   /Q - Quote parent message (only if a reply)
   /R - Re-type a line
   /S - Save this message and leave
   /T - Try again (clears the message and starts over)
   /Z - Save this message and request return receipt
